# rsync/rclone --exclude-from list for the offsite sync of the DuckLake Parquet files (ADR-0002).
# Request Engine response bodies are raw JSON, pruned after 90 days; Bars are the durable product of every
# response, so they are never backed up offsite. Keep the responses directory (MARKET_RESPONSES_DIR) outside
# MARKET_DATA_PATH; if it is nested inside, these patterns exclude it.
responses/
*.json.gz
